ribe\/events\/v1\/events\/17326","title":"Diwali-2026","description":"<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"an1 CToWUd\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/fonts.gstatic.com\/s\/e\/notoemoji\/17.0\/1fa94\/32.png\" alt=\"\ud83e\ude94\" data-emoji=\"\ud83e\ude94\" aria-label=\"\ud83e\ude94\" data-bit=\"iit\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"an1 CToWUd\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/fonts.gstatic.com\/s\/e\/notoemoji\/17.0\/2728\/32.png\" alt=\"\u2728\" data-emoji=\"\u2728\" aria-label=\"\u2728\" data-bit=\"iit\" \/>\u00a0M\u00fcnchen Tamil Sangam\u2019s Diwali Celebration 2026 is coming up, and we are excited to bring our community together for a wonderful celebration of Tamil culture, music and dance!\u00a0<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"an1 CToWUd\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/fonts.gstatic.com\/s\/e\/notoemoji\/17.0\/1f3b6\/32.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udfb6\" data-emoji=\"\ud83c\udfb6\" aria-label=\"\ud83c\udfb6\" data-bit=\"iit\" \/><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"an1 CToWUd\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/fonts.gstatic.com\/s\/e\/notoemoji\/17.0\/1f483\/32.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udc83\" data-emoji=\"\ud83d\udc83\" aria-label=\"\ud83d\udc83\" data-bit=\"iit\" \/><\/p>\n<p>People celebrate by lighting oil lamps, bursting fireworks, cleaning and decorating their homes, and sharing sweets. It is a time for friends and family gatherings, prayers, and expressing gratitude for prosperity and well-being.<\/p>\n<p>It&#8217;s a day to cheer on friends and family, to encourage the little ones as they take their first playful steps into our traditions, and to relish the joy of togetherness.<\/p>\n<p>We invite everyone to join us in this celebration, to be a part of this beautiful tapestry of culture and joy. Let&#8217;s make memories that will be cherished for years to come.<\/p>\n<p>Diwali 2026 event QR code:<br \/>\n<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-17396\" src=\"https:\/\/muenchentamilsangam.org\/wp-content\/u